"Onboarding Welcome Step" = "One media hub";
"Onboarding Welcome Title" = "Local, remote, and revisit now live in one flow";
"Onboarding Welcome Body" = "Gen Player is no longer just a player. Start from local files or remote libraries, then come back through history and favorites to the right details and playback entry.";
"Onboarding Welcome Highlight 1" = "Local files, remote libraries, and downloads now share one browsing language.";
"Onboarding Welcome Highlight 2" = "History and favorites can take you back to the matching details screen.";
"Onboarding Welcome Highlight 3" = "Video stays full screen by default, while audio keeps the floating and expanded window flow.";
"Onboarding Welcome Chip 1" = "Unified browsing";
"Onboarding Welcome Chip 2" = "History returns to details";
"Onboarding Welcome Chip 3" = "Favorites stay linked";
"Onboarding Welcome Route Title" = "Start here";
"Onboarding Welcome Route Value" = "The main app is split into Local, Network, and My";
"Onboarding Welcome Note Title" = "Suggested first step";
"Onboarding Welcome Note Body" = "Learn the three main entries first, then decide whether to add a server or browse local files right away.";
"Onboarding Source Step" = "Connect sources";
"Onboarding Source Title" = "File protocols and full media libraries are both supported";
"Onboarding Source Body" = "The Network tab now does more than adding servers. It covers SMB, WebDAV, FTP, SFTP, NFS, plus Jellyfin, Emby, and Plex, with discovery built in.";
"Onboarding Source Highlight 1" = "File protocols and media services enter the correct browsing path based on their real type.";
"Onboarding Source Highlight 2" = "LAN discovery reduces manual entry and can prefill protocol and port values.";
"Onboarding Source Highlight 3" = "Passwords, tokens, and PINs are stored in Keychain only.";
"Onboarding Source Chip 1" = "Auto discovery";
"Onboarding Source Chip 2" = "Keychain protected";
"Onboarding Source Chip 3" = "Broad protocol support";
"Onboarding Source Route Title" = "Entry path";
"Onboarding Source Route Value" = "Network -> Add Server";
"Onboarding Source Note Title" = "Suggested first step";
"Onboarding Source Note Body" = "Add the server you use most first, make sure browsing and playback feel right, then bring in the rest.";
"Onboarding Privacy Step" = "Private access";
"Onboarding Privacy Title" = "Lock selected servers and folders behind Privacy Space";
"Onboarding Privacy Body" = "Privacy Space adds a separate unlock inside Gen Player. Protect a server or folder, hide locked items from lists, and optionally keep private playback out of history.";
"Onboarding Privacy Highlight 1" = "Turn it on in Settings first, then add protection from a server or folder menu.";
"Onboarding Privacy Highlight 2" = "Locked content can require Face ID, Touch ID, or your privacy password before it appears.";
"Onboarding Privacy Highlight 3" = "You can hide protected items from browse lists and keep their playback progress out of history.";
"Onboarding Privacy Chip 1" = "Protect servers & folders";
"Onboarding Privacy Chip 2" = "Biometric unlock";
"Onboarding Privacy Chip 3" = "Keep history clean";
"Onboarding Privacy Route Title" = "Entry path";
"Onboarding Privacy Route Value" = "Settings -> Privacy Space -> server or folder menu";
"Onboarding Privacy Note Title" = "Suggested first step";
"Onboarding Privacy Note Body" = "Protect one test folder first, lock Privacy Space once, then confirm unlock and history behavior feel right.";
"Onboarding Offline Step" = "Offline first";
"Onboarding Offline Title" = "Downloads are now more than a task list";
"Onboarding Offline Body" = "The download center now connects media details, local files, and playback. You can track task state, finished items, and file location, while playback prefers offline files when they exist.";
"Onboarding Offline Highlight 1" = "It supports the full queued, downloading, paused, completed, failed, and canceled lifecycle.";
"Onboarding Offline Highlight 2" = "Finished items can jump straight to Show in Folder for easier offline file management.";
"Onboarding Offline Highlight 3" = "When an offline copy exists, details and playback can prefer the local file first.";
"Onboarding Offline Chip 1" = "Track every state";
"Onboarding Offline Chip 2" = "Show in Folder";
"Onboarding Offline Chip 3" = "Prefer local playback";
"Onboarding Offline Route Title" = "Entry path";
"Onboarding Offline Route Value" = "Details -> Download, or My -> Downloads";
"Onboarding Offline Note Title" = "Suggested first step";
"Onboarding Offline Note Body" = "Download one movie or one episode first, then try offline playback and jump to its local folder.";
"Onboarding Gesture Step" = "Play and return";
"Onboarding Gesture Title" = "From browsing to playback and back to details, without losing the thread";
"Onboarding Gesture Body" = "Playback now focuses on continuity: gestures, pre-play track selection, history revisit, and favorites all stay on the same details-to-playback path.";
"Onboarding Gesture Highlight 1" = "Use double tap seek, fine-grained scrubbing, and the core playback controls with less friction.";
"Onboarding Gesture Highlight 2" = "Pick audio and subtitle tracks in details through Playback Options before playback starts.";
"Onboarding Gesture Highlight 3" = "History, favorites, and My can all bring you back to the matching media details screen.";
